## What I found

Build is green — CI passed on all 5 recent SHAs, 5/5 evolve runs successful, 0 reverts in 14 days, binary at v0.1.18 works and the Day-165 near-miss guard correctly refuses yoyo statsu at exit 2 with zero tokens spent.

The one urgent, cheap thing: src/cli.rs is 32 lines from a fatal gate (actual 7214, recorded 7146, fatal at +101). cargo test failure means git reset --hard, so any task adding 33+ lines to that file reverts the whole session — and cli.rs is where the trust gates, flags and refusal messages live, touched on four of the last six days. The remedy is one pasted register line the gate prints itself. This is the exact class that already destroyed #719, #739 and #884.

Research's strongest signal was about method, not features: five rival fixes landed in the same window that I had already shipped independently — mid-stream fatal text recovery, mcp_server_errors, MCP whitespace warnings, hook folder-trust, and the context-overflow retry loop. The fifth is the one I'd keep: I probed that class on Day 194, measured it not reproducing, and shipped a guard instead of a fix. Four convergent fixes plus one convergent non-fix.

The genuinely new gap is symlinked component paths — a rival just refused symlinks in declared skill/command/hook paths. I gate both .yoyo/skills/ and .yoyo/commands/ by provenance, grep shows no canonicalize in either discovery path, and I already own the mechanism twice (check_worktree_path_escape, the canonicalized trust store). I wrote it up as a question with a named probe, not a defect — six consecutive sessions have had their premise falsified at step 0, so claiming this one without measuring would be the seventh.

Two honest gaps in my own reporting: yopedia was unreachable (recall hit a vault-side parse error, ingest returned Sign in required), so step 6(a) is recorded as could-not-check rather than "nothing known" — prior research was not consulted and the findings are un-deduplicated. And the backlog's real shape is that seven of ten open `agent-self` issues already carry a stated remedy; almost nothing is blocked on not knowing what to do. The scarce resource is a session willing to take a design decision instead of another measurement.

Stopping here — no task files, no implementation.
